/-
Checks `syscallDecodeG1` (PrivacyCash/Model/Bn254.lean), the model's account of
how the `alt_bn128` syscalls read a G1 point, against solana-bn254 (the
implementation LiteSVM's validator runs). The decoder is observed through the
addition syscall: `alt_bn128_addition(b ‖ 0)` fails exactly when `b` does not
decode, and otherwise returns the decoded point, re-encoded.

The vectors between the GENERATED markers are printed by
`formal-verification/conformance/src/bin/g1_vectors.rs` (the identity, the
generator, the verifying key's points, multiples of the generator, every flag
combination, out-of-range and off-curve coordinates, random bytes);
`scripts/check_vectors.sh` regenerates them and fails if they differ.
-/
